Z||000003||Cheever2||07-26-2001||11:51 AM||||914: yeah, that stinks, but it goes to show how important it is to leave a deposit on a car you're serious about & don't want someone else to get.  I don't know how many times I've heard something like this happen.<BR><P>------------------<BR>- <I>Chuck Hodges</I> -<BR><A HREF="http://home.houston.rr.com/fieropartsrelay" TARGET=_blank> Fiero Parts Relay</A> administrator||||reg||1
