Z||000005||CoolBlue87GT||07-26-2001||12:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroGT 914:<BR><B>Turns out the @#$*&! said he sold the car<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, been there, must have been the same guy that way going to sell me his trailer. He did the same thing. Told me he never had a title, was using his boat trailer tag !<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1_98.jpg"> <P>I see in one of your pic's a trailer. What kind was that ?  The fiero's not all the way forward. Was that to balance/level it ?||||reg||6
Z||000006||FieroGT 914||07-26-2001||01:07 PM||||hey coolblue - the trailer in the pic was borrowed from a friend of my dad.  he custom built it and uses it for his race car.  the reason the fiero wasn't foward all the way is because there were hooks welded to the rails near the back tires and it was easier to strap the car down using them. it actually worked out well because the steel braided cords with hooks that we used fit nicely in the tire tread grooves and kept the car secure. we couldn't the chains to fit underneath the car in the rear to compress the suspension so using the tires did the trick with no probs and it was a 6 hour ride home!||||reg||1
Z||000007||Ken Wittlief||07-26-2001||01:45 PM||||dont feel too bad - maybe fate was looking out for you - often no title =&gt; stolen car.<P>  maybe he got wind from your personality that you were not looking for a stolen car.||||reg||10
Z||000008||CoolBlue87GT||07-26-2001||05:40 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroGT 914:<BR><B>hey coolblue - the trailer in the pic was borrowed from a friend of my dad</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I used web straps w/hooks,ratchet on the front and back.  I also used the "oh my god" chains front and back.<P>I'm having a local company design a custom trailer for me.  It has to be 19 1/2 or less in total length (tongue to tail), as I need it to fit in my garage which is 20' long.<BR>||||reg||6
